{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e891d6006945d2809aaf","chatId":"671ceeb6ad444457b1735481b66f8996","sessionId":null,"userId":67856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1037,"promptTokens":1477,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:21"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908709544805124,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e891d6006945d2809aae","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369681618,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e891d6006945d2809aae","chatId":"671ceeb6ad444457b1735481b66f8996","sessionId":null,"userId":67856,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n阿娜莉亚在她的喜剧小品上非常努力，并且昨晚在很多人面前表演了她的单口相声。轮到她之前，她对上台感到很紧张。当她开始讲笑话时，你可以听到两个街区外的观众在哭。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，阿娜莉亚最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬\nB) 好奇\nC) 愧疚\nD) 惊喜\nE) 失望\nF) 激动\n\n## 问题 2\n阿娜莉亚为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 观众觉得她的笑话很好笑，因为他们都笑得哭出来了\nB) 阿娜莉亚在舞台上摔倒了\nC) 她的表演轮到结束，她不必再经历那样的事情了\nD) 观众因为她的笑话感到难过并哭泣。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908709544805124,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e891d6006945d2809aaf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369681615,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6a7cb72eed2e4fc6be8144ec196bd049"}